<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-8312] .NET: CacheAbstractTransactionalTest.TestTxRollbackOnly failure</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8312</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;Test(s) failed.   Expected: &amp;lt;Apache.Ignite.Core.Transactions.TransactionRollbackException&amp;gt;
  But was:  &amp;lt;Apache.Ignite.Core.Common.IgniteException&amp;gt; (Invalid transaction state for prepare [state=MARKED_ROLLBACK, tx=GridNearPessimisticTxPrepareFuture [innerFuts=[], super=GridCompoundFuture [rdc=org.apache.ignite.internal.processors.cache.distributed.near.GridNearTxPrepareFutureAdapter$1@62e703a4, initFlag=0, lsnrCalls=0, done=false, cancelled=false, err=null, futs=[]]]])
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Caused by changes made in &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;1&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;1&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-7770&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-7770&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
