                            <comment id="16442837" author="githubbot" created="Wed, 18 Apr 2018 16:49:47 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user andrey-kuznetsov opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/3870&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/3870&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8312&quot; title=&quot;.NET: CacheAbstractTransactionalTest.TestTxRollbackOnly failure&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-8312&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-8312&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: Simplified the choice of exception thrown in pessimistic&#8230;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &#8230; &quot;prepare-after-rollback&quot; scenario.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;You can merge this pull request into a Git repository by running:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    $ git pull &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/andrey-kuznetsov/ignite&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/andrey-kuznetsov/ignite&lt;/a&gt; ignite-8312&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Alternatively you can review and apply these changes as the patch at:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/3870.patch&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/3870.patch&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To close this pull request, make a commit to your master/trunk branch&lt;br/&gt;
with (at least) the following in the commit message:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    This closes #3870&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;commit d6cf50e7a3c6c33a4c122b056897576c06f6ec7c&lt;br/&gt;
Author: Andrey Kuznetsov &amp;lt;stkuzma@...&amp;gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Date:   2018-04-18T16:48:44Z&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8312&quot; title=&quot;.NET: CacheAbstractTransactionalTest.TestTxRollbackOnly failure&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-8312&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-8312&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: Simplified the choice of exception thrown in pessimistic &quot;prepare-after-rollback&quot; scenario.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;hr /&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16444132" author="andrey-kuznetsov" created="Thu, 19 Apr 2018 14:38:59 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;It&apos;s natural to throw the &lt;tt&gt;TransactionRollbackException&lt;/tt&gt; when prepare occurs both after manual and automatic (caused by timeout) rollback. I&apos;ve restored this behaviour for manual case. &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=agura&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;agura&quot;&gt;agura&lt;/a&gt;, could you review the change, please?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16444365" author="dpavlov" created="Thu, 19 Apr 2018 16:45:31 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;TransactionRollbackException&lt;/tt&gt;&#160; is thrown in case automatic rollback.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://apacheignite.readme.io/docs/transactions#section-handling-failed-transactions&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://apacheignite.readme.io/docs/transactions#section-handling-failed-transactions&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Probably we need to mention case of not automatic (manual) rollback in javadoc &amp;amp; docs&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16444415" author="andrey-kuznetsov" created="Thu, 19 Apr 2018 17:20:52 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=dpavlov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;dpavlov&quot;&gt;dpavlov&lt;/a&gt;, current PR mentions this in javadoc. I&apos;ve created &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;1&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; in order to make a change in docs.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;1&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8329&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8329&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16449717" author="andrey-kuznetsov" created="Tue, 24 Apr 2018 12:09:36 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Since commit &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;1&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; was merged to master, there is no more need in the change proposed. Currently, PR only affects javadoc.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;1&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/commit/2b5d2fc5fee9b8d722f919b2d92750f139d07876&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/commit/2b5d2fc5fee9b8d722f919b2d92750f139d07876&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16450076" author="agura" created="Tue, 24 Apr 2018 15:39:23 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Thanks, Andrey! LGTM. Merged to master branch.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16515868" author="githubbot" created="Mon, 18 Jun 2018 15:18:45 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user andrey-kuznetsov closed the pull request at:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/3870&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/3870&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
